    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="79d71c48-4992-5f6a-8eee-0573ef1cfde0" activityNameId="99044aab-a639-5de7-959d-eb0f2b3d1810" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass tube, borosilicate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass tube, borosilicate, at plant
Production of borosilicate glass tubes.;
UUID: 32409045-2a0b-35d9-b768-0075f65d8313
Gate to gate inventory for the production of glass tubes.
Location: Production plant in DE. Some pre-products and waste treatment services estimated with European and Swiss data.
Technology: Tube glass manufacturing. Plant data for joint production of borosilicate (20%) and lime-natron-glass (80%) tubes.
Time period: Production data for one business year.
Production volume: 2300 t/a.
Sampling: Questionnaire. 
Extrapolations: Input of raw materials is calculated with data for borosilicate glass. Other data are from a plant with a production mix of borosilicate (20%) and lime-natron-glass (80%).
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32409045-2a0b-35d9-b768-0075f65d8313.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="948c6fdb-25b0-54ae-bf5c-e320176f724c" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
